{
  "key": "letter-126-part-01",
  "number": 126,
  "generationId": "01a1e6bf-8669-7cf1-a88f-d6118e9a6892",
  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Love.",
      "path": "audio/1970-126/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.625692
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Everything changes except change, only change is eternal.",
      "path": "audio/1970-126/02.mp3",
      "start": 1.869456,
      "end": 5.600113
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "But the human mind lives in the past - and that is the confusion of all confusions.",
      "path": "audio/1970-126/03.mp3",
      "start": 6.880272,
      "end": 12.164670999999998
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "One day the sky was filled with the clouds of war - plane upon plane loaded with death.",
      "path": "audio/1970-126/04.mp3",
      "start": 13.388889,
      "end": 18.330816000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Beasts, birds, worms and beetles - all that could flee, fled Horses, donkeys, rats, sheep, dogs and cats, wolves - all ran for their lives and the paths and tracks were full of them.",
      "path": "audio/1970-126/05.mp3",
      "start": 19.647256,
      "end": 32.574625999999995
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "As they fled, this multitude saw two vultures sitting on a wall by the road.",
      "path": "audio/1970-126/06.mp3",
      "start": 34.167959,
      "end": 39.090453999999994
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Brothers! they cried to them.",
      "path": "audio/1970-126/07.mp3",
      "start": 40.645918,
      "end": 42.767029
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Flee!",
      "path": "audio/1970-126/08.mp3",
      "start": 44.219342000000005,
      "end": 45.048662
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "At once!",
      "path": "audio/1970-126/09.mp3",
      "start": 46.72263,
      "end": 47.823491999999995
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Man is on the warpath again.",
      "path": "audio/1970-126/10.mp3",
      "start": 49.413900000000005,
      "end": 52.92
    }
  ]
}
